            <tr>
               <td>The Buyer waives in advance and acknowledges that it is not applicable neither I/ we nor any third party to whom I/ we may transfer my/ our interest in the Property shall not have any claim against the Developer, its directors, employees, agents, contractors or those for whom the Developer is responsible as a result.</td>
